{"title":"Monday Game Nights at LVLUP GAMES!","startsAt":"2026-10-19T17:00:00-04:00","endsAt":"2026-10-19T22:00:00-04:00","status":"ACTIVE","type":"PHYSICAL","description":"We invite you to join us to play games and socialize!\n\n**There is now a cut off for RSVPs. If you do not RSVP for an event on meetup, we cannot guarantee that we will have a seat available.**\n\nCAFE POLICIES\n\n1. There is an entry fee of 6/person + tax for this event. If you do not RSVP at least 4 hours prior to the event start on the day, the price will be 8+ tax. You must check in and pay upon arrival.\n\n3. We are a cafe and do not permit outside food and drink (water bottles excluded). However, you may bring food in from the other food businesses (Henry's, Vito's, not the convenience store) in the plaza to support our neighbours\n\n5. Stay within the designated tables. We may have other events, reservations and walk-ins; we need to keep other tables clear in order to be able to best assess our seating capacity at all times. DO NOT REARRANGE TABLES WITHOUT CONSENT FROM STAFF\n\n7. Be considerate of other guests when selecting games from our library and limit the number of games you bring back to each table to two (2) at a time\n\n9. You are welcome to bring your own games to use in the cafe, but LVLUP GAMES is not responsible for lost, stolen, or otherwise damaged games/components\n\nAlso as a general meet up rule, to be considerate to other guests. Since we have limited seating, it is of the utmost importance that if you plan on attending you sign up for the event. Likewise, if you are unable to make it, kindly mark that you will not be coming so your spot becomes available for another per\n\nWe appreciate your understanding and cooperation. Hope to see you soon!","venue":{"name":"LVLUP GAMES","address":"833 Westlock Rd Unit #9, Mississauga","lat":43.566883,"lng":-79.64203,"city":"Mississauga"},"fee":{"amount":9.04,"currency":"CAD"},"group":"Mississauga Board Gamers United","image":"https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/5/e/1/b/highres_497964091.jpeg"}